OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1773713032
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0     G10/25
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, The Chancellor, Mr Nigel Lawson, has
OL,6, delivered his Budget speech to a packed
OL,7, House of Commons.
OL,9,FBritain's seventh successive year of
OL,10,Fgrowth made this year's Budget the most
OL,11,Ffavourable for years, he said.
OL,12,F
OL,13,FRetaining low inflation remained the
OL,14,Fprime objective, but the country's
OL,15,Feconomic performance enabled Mr Lawson
OL,16,Fto cut the basic rate of income tax to
OL,17,F27p in the pound, a reduction of 2p.
OL,19,FHe has also raised tax allowances by
OL,20,F#90 for a single person and #140 for a
OL,21,Fmarried man.
OL,22,F
OL,23,T]CFrom 17-03-87 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,497,190,120,250,0,100
PN,49611
SC,0011
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1773713032
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0     G11/25
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Civil List payments to members of the
OL,6, Royal Family are up 4.5 per cent for
OL,7, 1987 to #5,289,500, the Chancellor
OL,8, has told the Commons.
OL,10,FThe Queen's allowance rises from
OL,11,F#4,136,800 to #4,326,100, although
OL,12,Fshe refunds #371,700.
OL,14,FThe Prince and Princess of Wales are
OL,15,Fnot included in the Civil List as they
OL,16,Fdraw their income from the Duchy of
OL,17,FCornwall.
OL,19,FThe Duchess of York's expenses are
OL,20,Fdrawn from her husband's allowance,
OL,21,Fwhich was increased when they married.
OL,23,T]CFrom 17-03-87 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,497,190,120,250,0,100
PN,49612
SC,0012
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1773713032
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0     G12/25
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, The jury in the Old Bailey trial of
OL,6, three people accused of the murder of
OL,7, PC Keith Blakelock has been sent to a
OL,8, hotel overnight.
OL,10,FThe jury spent all day considering its
OL,11,Fverdict.
OL,13,FPC Blakelock was killed during a riot
OL,14,Fon the Broadwater Farm Estate in
OL,15,FTottenham, London, in October 1985.
OL,17,FThe three also face charges of riot
OL,18,Fand affray. A fourth, a juvenile, is
OL,19,Fcharged with riot and affray.
OL,21,FThe trial has lasted 38 days.
OL,22,F
OL,23,T]CFrom 17-03-87 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
