OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1773713032
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0     G15/25
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Seven black youths have been murdered
OL,6, in the black South African township of
OL,7, KwaMashu, near Durban, the government
OL,8, reported.
OL,10,FThe youths, aged between 15 and 17, had
OL,11,Fbullet and knife wounds, the Bureau for
OL,12,FInformation said. The motive for the
OL,13,Fkilling was not known, said a spokesman
OL,15,FLocal residents said there had recently
OL,16,Fbeen severe tension between the United
OL,17,FDemocratic Front anti-apartheid group
OL,18,Fand the Zulu organisation Inkatha.
OL,20,FReporting of the incident was affected
OL,21,Fby South Africa's emergency regulations
OL,23,T]CFrom 17-03-87 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
