OL,1,Q]Sp```php`` ```p(`p`pVV\         G17/25
OL,2,Q]S5jjjzjjjz jjjjjjjjj V]DENGLAND
OL,3,Q]S!"#(."#(. "#""""#"" V]DSELECTORS
OL,4,V |||||||||||||||||||||]|DDROP FOUR
OL,5,F
OL,6,FFour players have been dropped from
OL,7,FEngland's team for the match against
OL,8,FScotland on April 4.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FOut go captain Richard Hill, two other
OL,11,FBath forwards - Gareth Chilcott and
OL,12,FGraham Dawe - as well as Wade Dooley,
OL,13,Fthe giant Fylde lock.
OL,15,FDooley was widely expected to be
OL,16,Fpunished for punching Welsh forward
OL,17,FPhil Davies in the game in Cardiff on
OL,18,FMarch 7.
OL,19,F
OL,20,FThe rest of the team will be announced
OL,21,Fon March 25.
OL,23,Q]CFrom 17-03-86F ]Dteletextarchive.com
